ing or instruction following, which these guards do not test.","Speed is measured on one L40S with an FP8 decoder: per picture at batch 1 (vision tower, prefill and exactly 4 new tokens, so every model does the same work), pictures per second at batch 10, and tokens per second for 32 tokens at batch 1; medians of rounds run in rotated order. Decoding at about 10 tokens/s is roughly a third of what reading the FP8 weights (about 26 GB at 864 GB/s) would allow, so per-layer overheads dominate; other hardware, batch sizes or compiled kernels will give different savings.","Accuracy at the margin depends on numerics: the same cut can score one picture differently with image features computed per picture (scan, greedy) or inside the batch (pruned rows).","Answers are capped at 8 tokens, as in the Model Lab, and the prompt asks for one word. Deep cuts that start with a carrier phrase (\"The object in the picture is a te...\") are scored wrong, so their accuracy mixes naming with following the one-word instruction."],"answers_lost":{"confirmed":[],"guarded":[{"word":"paraguas","lang":"es","said":"Umbrella","code":"Formal"}],"perplexity_only":[{"word":"igloo","lang":"en","said":"Ighloo","code":"Nonword"},{"word":"paraguas","lang":"es","said":"Umbrella","code":"Formal"},{"word":"tetera","lang":"es","said":"Teterita","code":"Nonword"},{"word":"caracol","lang":"es","said":"Carácol","code":"Nonword"}],"deep_10":[{"word":"kettle","lang":"en","said":"The object in the picture is a te","code":"Description"},{"word":"cactus","lang":"en","said":"The object in the picture is a c","code":"Description"},{"word":"harp","lang":"en","said":"The object in the picture is a har","code":"Description"},{"word":"igloo","lang":"en","said":"The object in the picture is an ig","code":"Description"},{"word":"paraguas","lang":"es","said":"Umbrella","code":"Formal"},{"word":"tetera","lang":"es","said":"Manzana","code":"Unrelated"},{"word":"banco","lang":"es","said":"Asiento de jardín","code":"Descript